DDK_plots_*.pdf
DDK_mat/
reliability/

# Exception: demo/ is example data shipped on purpose, so none of the rules
# above apply to it. Keep this block LAST: in .gitignore the last matching
# pattern wins, and the negation must also re-include the folders.
!demo/**